{
  "_readme_comments": [
    "BENTO GRID CONFIGURATION & LAYOUT BLUEPRINT",
    "=============================================================================",
    "This web app utilizes a responsive 12-column CSS Grid (4 columns on mobile, 12 on tablet/desktop).",
    "To maintain perfect bento grid proportions without hardcoding CSS in markup, we define",
    "reusable layout dimension tokens inside 'gridTokens'.",
    "",
    "HOW TO READ GRID MEASURES (Width x Height Units):",
    "-----------------------------------------------------------------------------",
    "A standard bento unit is mapped to a column span of the 12-column grid:",
    "  - 1x1: 1 unit wide (3 columns span) x 1 unit high (square aspect-ratio).",
    "  - 2x1: 2 units wide (6 columns span) x 1 unit high (150px height).",
    "  - 2x2: 2 units wide (6 columns span) x 2 units high (300px height).",
    "  - 4x2: 4 units wide (12 columns span) x 2 units high (200px height).",
    "",
    "VISUALIZING GRID CARD UNITS:",
    "  +-------+   +---------------+   +---------------+",
    "  |  1x1  |   |      2x1      |   |               |",
    "  |       |   +---------------+   |      2x2      |",
    "  +-------+                       |               |",
    "                                  +---------------+",
    "",
    "STANDARD 12-COLUMN TRACK SEGMENTATION SCHEMA:",
    "  +---+---+---+---+---+---+---+---+---+---+---+---+  (12 Columns total)",
    "  |      1x1      |      1x1      |      2x1      |",
    "  |  (3 columns)  |  (3 columns)  |  (6 columns)  |",
    "  +---------------+---------------+---------------+",
    "  |              2x2              |      2x1      |",
    "  |          (6 columns)          |  (6 columns)  |",
    "  +-------------------------------+---------------+",
    "",
    "HOMEPAGE-SPECIFIC MEASURES (prefixed with 'home-'):",
    "-----------------------------------------------------------------------------",
    "These handle responsive columns scaling from 1 (mobile) -> 2 (tablet) -> 4 (desktop) layout units:",
    "  - home-2x1: Spans 4 columns wide.",
    "  - home-2x2: Spans 4 columns wide, 2 grid rows high.",
    "  - home-4x2: Spans 8 columns wide, 2 grid rows high (Homepage Hero).",
    "",
    "VISUALIZING HOMEPAGE LAYOUT COMPOSITION:",
    "  +-----------------------------------+-----------+  (12 Columns total)",
    "  |             home-4x2              | home-2x2  |",
    "  |            (8 columns)            | (4 cols)  |",
    "  |                                   |           |",
    "  +-----------+-----------+-----------+-----------+",
    "  | home-2x1  | home-2x1  | home-2x1  | home-2x1  |",
    "  | (4 cols)  | (4 cols)  | (4 cols)  | (4 cols)  |",
    "  +-----------+-----------+-----------+-----------+",
    "",
    "HOW TO APPLY:",
    "  1. Assign any of these dimension keys as the 'token' on cluster items.",
    "  2. Resolve them dynamically in Astro templates via: bentoConfig.gridTokens[token]."
  ],
